e less important than schools and safety\n1100-1500\n450k max ideal\nwithin 30 minutes of Albany hospital\nCorvallis is preferred, but feels harder\nSome cosmetic is ok, but no huge repairs\nWant to get established\nCheck out electrical panels\nCandice starts Aug, close by end of june","{\"boldtrail\":\"note\"}","support-admin","support-admin",0,1,0],["import-activity-736-2","import-client-736",null,"note",null,null,null,"2026-04-30T19:42:27.000Z","BoldTrail changed the spouse Email, spouse Phone Number, spouse First Name, and spouse Last Name","{\"boldtrail\":\"field-change\",\"event\":{\"summary\":\"changed the spouse Email, spouse Phone Number, spouse First Name, and spouse Last Name\",\"automation\":\"field-change\"},\"fields\":[{\"label\":\"Spouse Email\",\"value\":\"Not set → candi.m.dawson@gmail.com\"},{\"label\":\"Spouse Phone Number\",\"value\":\"Not set → 208-353-3050\"},{\"label\":\"Spouse First Name\",\"value\":\"Not set → Candice\"},{\"label\":\"Spouse Last Name\",\"value\":\"Not set → Dawson\"}],\"changes\":[{\"field\":\"spouse Email\",\"before\":\"\",\"after\":\"candi.m.dawson@gmail.com\"},{\"field\":\"spouse Phone Number\",\"before\":\"\",\"after\":\"208-353-3050\"},{\"field\":\"spouse First Name\",\"before\":\"\",\"after\":\"Candice\"},{\"field\":\"spouse Last Name\",\"before\":\"\",\"after\":\"Dawson\"}]}","support-admin","support-admin",0,1,0],["import-activity-736-3","import-client-736",null,"note",null,null,null,"2026-04-30T20:09:05.000Z","3915 Windy Ave NE Albany, - Location is good, nice neighborhood that is growing, close to i5 and Costco, Timber Ridge is a well rated school, house is newer but not much yard, probably my #1 Albany choice despite the lack of yard- https://zsvc.paragon.ice.com/s/goto/iwx7F187Z0\n6097 Lanier St SW Albany, - decent location, I know the seller who is also the agent, house is pretty small but there is a converted space not included in the sq ft. Pretty basic, my concern would be the space is too small long term - h